[00:00.000] 作词 : Angelo De Augustine
[00:01.000] 作曲 : Angelo De Augustine
[00:17.246] It’s been a long, long time to wait
[00:25.796] Due cause to leave, though still you stay
[00:34.646] Not for a moment do you hesitate
[00:43.239]
[00:43.590] I'm glad I know someone
[00:48.646] With a love so kind to hold my heart
[00:57.602]
[01:01.273] You kept me here when I was lost
[01:10.051] You cry your tears till fears exhaust
[01:18.859] Your own mind, you always find the good at any cost
[01:27.227]
[01:27.644] I'm glad I know someone
[01:32.724] With a love so kind to hold my heart
[01:41.699]
[01:46.436] If you feel left behind
[01:51.295] Just know I'm always on your side
[01:58.622]
[02:00.816] It's more like a picture that you sit and watch
[02:09.514] Without a composer and void of a plot
[02:18.308] I can't see the future, but no matter what
[02:27.053]
[02:27.150] I'm glad I know someone with a love so kind
[02:35.897] I'm glad I know someone with a love so kind
[02:44.815] I'm glad I know someone with a love so kind
